{"title": "The Guns of Azaron", "pageid": 2056, "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 223px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/princeofamber/images/2/20/The_Guns_of_Azaron.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20100805160312\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Author          Roger Zelazny\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/princeofamber/images/2/20/The_Guns_of_Azaron.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/223?cb=20100805160312\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"223\" height=\"303\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"The Guns of Azaron.jpg\" data-image-key=\"The_Guns_of_Azaron.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:The_Guns_of_Azaron.jpg\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">Author          Roger Zelazny</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure><p>The Guns of Azaron is the second book in the <a href=\"/wiki/The_Chronicles_of_Yander\" title=\"The Chronicles of Yander\">Chronicles of Yander</a> series by Roger Zelazny. The book continues straight from the previous volume, <a href=\"/wiki/Nine_Princes_in_Yander\" title=\"Nine Princes in Yander\">Nine Princes in Yander</a>, although it includes a recap.\n</p><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Characters\">Characters</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fprinceofamber.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FThe_Guns_of_Azaron%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h4>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Pavel\" title=\"Pavel\">Pavel of Yander</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Chronoron\" title=\"Chronoron\">Chronoron of Yander</a> (as <a href=\"/wiki/Alfred\" title=\"Alfred\">Alfred</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Peter\" title=\"Peter\">Peter of Yander</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/O'Briain\" title=\"O'Briain\">O'Briain</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Kripke\" title=\"Kripke\">Kripke of Yander</a></li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Plot\">Plot</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fprinceofamber.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FThe_Guns_of_Azaron%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>After regenerating his eyes and escaping Kripke's dungeon in <i>Nine Princes of Yander</i>, Pavel tries to muster a force once more. While gunpowder does not function in Yander, he knows of a substance, <a href=\"/wiki/Jeweler%27s_Rouge\" title=\"Jeweler&#39;s Rouge\">Jeweler's Rouge</a>, that will, and can be used as such. He walks in shadow and by accident meets <a href=\"/wiki/Alfred\" title=\"Alfred\">Alfred</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/Chronoron\" title=\"Chronoron\">or rather, who he <i>believes</i> is Alfred...)</a>, a man who he exiled while ruling a shadow world known as <span class=\"new\" title=\"Azaron (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQXZhbG9uP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Azaron</span> (probably a parody of the <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Azaron\">legendary island</a>). They join forces against strange forces who are attacking the land over which <a href=\"/wiki/Alfred\" title=\"Alfred\">Alfred</a> rules. They find <a href=\"/wiki/Peter\" title=\"Peter\">Peter</a>, ruling over a <a href=\"/wiki/Shadow\" title=\"Shadow\">shadow</a> of Azaron, and <a href=\"/wiki/O'Briain\" title=\"O'Briain\">O'Briain</a>, future mother of <a href=\"/wiki/Pavel\" title=\"Pavel\">Pavel</a>'s son, <a href=\"/wiki/Moorlin\" title=\"Moorlin\">Moorlin</a>. They leave the shadow-Azaron, but Peter pursues them, in a fit of rage, accusing them of the murder of his servants, whose bodies Pavel and Alfred found the day before their departure. Peter is knocked unconcious, and Pavel calls on Gattler to help him. Later, they discover a strange <a href=\"/wiki/Black_Road\" title=\"Dark Highway\">Dark Highway</a> stretching towards Yander. They find <a href=\"/wiki/Jeweler%27s_Rouge\" title=\"Jeweler&#39;s Rouge\">Jeweler's Rouge</a>, and muster their forces in one final attack on Yander (Pavel's previous attempt with <a href=\"/wiki/Bleys\" title=\"Bleys\">Bleys</a> having failed). Alfred helps him (Chronoron having previously voiced his support for Pavel when Pavel managed to contact him via his trump in <i><a href=\"/wiki/Nine_Princes_in_Yander\" title=\"Nine Princes in Yander\">Nine Princes of Yander</a></i>), and they win, Pavel taking the <a href=\"/wiki/Jewel_of_Judgement\" title=\"Jewel of Judgement\">Jewel of Judgement</a> from Kripke's dead breast. Later, they find O'Briain walking the pattern, succeeding, and naming herself an enemy of Yander.\n</p><p>See also: \n</p>\n<dl><dd><div class=\"notice metadata plainlinks\" id=\"stub\"><i>This article is a <a href=\"/wiki/Category:Article_stubs\" title=\"Category:Article stubs\">stub</a>. You can help Amberpedia Wiki by  <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://princeofamber.fandom.com/wiki/The_Guns_of_Azaron?action=edit\">expanding it</a>.</i></div></dd></dl>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260425233306\nCache expiry: 1209600\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.013 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.021 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 21/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 358/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    1.572      1 Template:Stub\n100.00%    1.572      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.1_prod_princeofamber:pcache:idhash:2056-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260425233306 and revision id 4507. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>", "sections": [{"toclevel": 1, "level": "4", "line": "Characters", "number": "1", "index": "1", "fromtitle": "The_Guns_of_Azaron", "byteoffset": 303, "anchor": "Characters", "linkAnchor": "Characters"}, {"toclevel": 1, "level": "3", "line": "Plot", "number": "2", "index": "2", "fromtitle": "The_Guns_of_Azaron", "byteoffset": 468, "anchor": "Plot", "linkAnchor": "Plot"}], "links": [{"ns": 14, "title": "Category:Article stubs", "exists": true}, {"ns": 0, "title": "Peter", "exists": true}, {"ns": 0, "title": "Dark Highway", "exists": true}, {"ns": 0, "title": "Bleys", "exists": true}, {"ns": 0, "title": "Pavel", "exists": true}, {"ns": 0, "title": "O'Briain", "exists": true}, {"ns": 0, "title": "Kripke", "exists": true}, {"ns": 0, "title": "Alfred", "exists": true}, {"ns": 0, "title": "Jewel of Judgement", "exists": true}, {"ns": 0, "title": "Jeweler's Rouge", 